# A Model:Samples on MIDI in (0.15.22): Notes M:S, its tracks' channels say what (1 next chord, 2 fill, 3 breakdown, 4 build, 5 drop, 6 next piece);
# Knob CCs: in, its filter (74), resonance (71), delay send (12), reverb send (13) turn Filter, Crush, Throw, Wash, the mod wheel (1) the mood;
# out, the FX knobs send the same numbers as they turn (not what came in). Both kept.
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 7
wait 100
expect fxpage 26
spin K1 1
wait 100
spin K1 1
wait 200
expect minpads 2
spin K4 1
wait 100
spin K4 1
wait 100
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect ccmode 3
shot midiin_ms.png
# track 3 (channel 3, any note): the breakdown on the bar
midi 92 30 64
wait 2500
expect sec 1
# track 6: the next piece on the bar
midi 95 30 64
wait 2500
expect piece 1
# the knobs: the filter right down (low-pass), the delay send full, the mood from the wheel
midi B0 4A 00
midi B3 0C 7F
midi B0 01 7F
wait 100
expect fxk0 -50
expect fxk2 100
expect mood 100
expect ccout74 0
expect ccout12 0
# out: the Filter knob turned (the visualizers: the FX knobs) goes out as CC 74, on each channel the map uses (GM: 1-4 and 10)
tap FX
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect ccout74 5
# kept
# CC 64 (a sustain pedal, an editor's REC, 0.16.6): Freeze while it is down, in any mode
midi B0 40 7F
wait 100
expect frozen 1
midi B0 40 00
wait 100
expect frozen 0
wait 6000
reboot
wait 3000
expect minpads 2
expect ccmode 3
